<main class="container py-5">
  <h1>Format &amp; Schedule</h1>
  <p class="lead">A full-day, Dagstuhl-style ("Barstuhl") workshop: discussion-driven,
    not a paper track.</p>

  <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mb-5">
    <li class="list-group-item">
      <strong>Plenary lightning pitches</strong> &middot; ~90 minutes<br>
      Short position-statement pitches from all participants to surface perspectives
      and form breakout groups.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      <strong>Breakout sessions</strong> &middot; ~180 minutes<br>
      Three parallel groups, one per topic pillar (see <a href="topics.html">Topics</a>),
      with a reshuffle partway through so participants engage with more than one pillar.
    </li>
    <li class="list-group-item">
      <strong>Alignment &amp; synthesis plenary</strong> &middot; 60&ndash;90 minutes<br>
      Breakout groups report back; the room converges on shared conclusions and next steps.
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p>Exact timings and room assignment will be finalized closer to the workshop day
    (25 or 26 October 2026, assigned by the ISWC chairs).</p>
</main>

